  questDefinition: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2d3a8f3c1b2749e7a6c14a1c0f6b3210, type: 2}
  offerTitle: Beginner Ski Lesson
  offerDialogue: Ready for your first lesson? We'll start with skating, leaning,
    turning, and getting your first pass.
  acceptedDialogue: Great. Start by moving around me, then I'll send you toward
    the resort.
  inProgressDialogue: Keep working through the basics. Move, turn, brake, then
    check in at the resort.
  completedDialogue: Nice. You know enough to start exploring safely.
  turnInDialogue: That's your first lesson done. Come back when you want to learn
    faster movement.
